{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:18 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:18 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:18 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"「祝願」廖康銘中三元\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/55e9550e6c57de06294eba1956e30f1f/2026-11/r8_5.jpg\"/><p>今日沙田第八場馬會一哩錦標，岀現四駒衝線鏡頭，結果由潘頓策騎廖康銘馬房的「祝願」，力壓轉沈廄初岀的「小鳥天堂」和「錶之銀河」險勝，潘頓今日贏得第五場頭馬，廖廄亦連中三元。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ea6ed81a5f8959f00b78c348dadb0257/2026-11/8fb74dba-f495-4647-abd7-471f61b6e1ce.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/70e7f2034a7b1d31e9baabec89d9215e/2026-11/44c6e2f1-47a6-4c3e-8c78-464609129683.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5042efa47197a5e44daf34fe76c21c59/2026-11/354bb49d-0cfe-47dd-ab7a-0114129c77c2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/05079bf3de3fbce9d2063b5629f896ab/2026-11/386ea2fc-ad4d-48e4-839a-f0980223f914.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f2da344ad21d6437dff54868a47933be/2026-11/660d9692-f8df-4b87-962a-2fa2e73f8364.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d2dbd2e3f343769fde644181da3b409f/2026-11/2601a75c-a535-4782-938e-8aca311f0543.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/116cedd3ed6d8a54aab7929602e2a4d9/2026-11/3136bb86-9d94-4ca3-b196-afe4bbf3f0a6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9044009923d6a05e5e125195ebe3e399/2026-11/39692ffb-9b41-4be0-b91e-91129e133371.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9baa52068a5fa6de9169636b181a2ed8/2026-11/51347f23-e019-4382-8cdb-375f99aab648.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/73399d63e1d204c4117991911c2291ba/2026-11/17333658-08f2-4edf-b20b-95c1dff50640.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/39d7e1755c938abddfc9a8a2240b3694/2026-11/25641173-0577-4b00-91cb-4a58b9e1f9fb.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1a7d8b601295f64d53ec70dc9811286c/2026-11